  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring and Assessing Population Movements in Turkey through the Migrant Presence Monitoring (MPM) Programme -Phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following the successful progress of the second phase of IOM&apos;s programme, IOM will continue its data collection activities to provide access to comprehensive information to Directorate General of Migration Management and service providers in the field of migration, under this third phase of the project. This project ensures a continuation of the intervention to ensure the coverage of data collection in Istanbul, as well as in provinces of A&#x11f;r&#x131;, Van, &#xc7;anakkale, Edirne, Gaziantep, Istanbul, Izmir through the key flow monitoring points.</narrative>
  </description>
